  "body": "Ready to make the move into your first home? This could be the opportunity you’ve been waiting for!\r\n\r\nComfortable and perfectly liveable as it is, this great three-bedroom home gives you the chance to get your foot on the property ladder now, then gradually refresh and personalise it over time. There’s no need to do everything at once. Simply move in, make it your own and enjoy the freedom of having a place to call home, with the added potential to add value as your plans and budget allow.\r\n\r\nAnd for investors, this is an opportunity well worth considering too. With three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a practical layout and a location within easy reach of the beach, schools, shops and transport, it offers the fundamentals of a solid rental property and an appealing addition to any portfolio.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 130sqm of floor area, with three double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a cosy north-facing living area flowing seamlessly into the open-plan dining space, this home offers just the right amount of room to settle in, make your own and enjoy. A single internal access garage, excellent storage and a fully fenced, beautifully created low-maintenance garden add even more practicality, while the sunny orientation makes the living spaces a lovely place to relax.\r\n\r\nAnd the location is hard to beat!\r\n\r\nFrom your front gate, it’s an easy stroll down to beautiful Red Beach, while the local shopping centre is conveniently located at the other end of the street. The local primary school is also within walking distance, and when you’re ready to explore a little further, Orewa is just five minutes away by car with its gorgeous beach, cafes, shops and amenities.\r\n\r\nWith public transport close by and motorway access within easy reach, getting to work, school or enjoying everything the Hibiscus Coast has to offer is wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a first-home buyer looking for a home with heart, sunshine and the opportunity to add value over time, or an investor looking for a well-positioned property to add to your portfolio, this is a smart opportunity in a location that continues to deliver.\r\n\r\nCall us now to view, or we look forward to seeing you at our open home.",
